### Période : restaurant -40 non pointée (CB)
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{accA.id}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{alice.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "categoryId": "{{resto.id}}", "date": "2026-10-12", "description": "restaurant", "amount": "-4000" }

?? status == 201

