POST {{baseUrl}}/{{accA.id}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{alice.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "categoryId": "{{loyer.id}}", "date": "2026-10-20", "description": "loyer", "amount": "-80000", "pending": true }

?? status == 201

### CA1-CA3, CA7 (exemple A) : En banque 2900, À venir 2800, prévu 1750, reports -150, composition = prévu
# @name statsA
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{accA.id}}/periods/{{perA.id}}/reporting/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{alice.access_token}}

?? status == 200
?? js response.parsedBody.startBalance == 105000
?? js response.parsedBody.realBankBalance == 290000
?? js response.parsedBody.upcomingBalance == 280000
?? js response.parsedBody.forecastBalance == 175000
?? js response.parsedBody.cardTotal == -4000
?? js response.parsedBody.cardCount == 1
?? js response.parsedBody.billsTotal == -80000
?? js response.parsedBody.reportsTotal == -15000
?? js response.parsedBody.arrivedAfterEnd == 0
?? js response.parsedBody.budgetRemaining == -16000
?? js response.parsedBody.expectedIncome == 0
?? js Number(BigInt(response.parsedBody.realBankBalance) + BigInt(response.parsedBody.cardTotal) + BigInt(response.parsedBody.billsTotal) + BigInt(response.parsedBody.reportsTotal) + BigInt(response.parsedBody.arrivedAfterEnd) + BigInt(response.parsedBody.budgetRemaining) + BigInt(response.parsedBody.expectedIncome) - BigInt(response.parsedBody.forecastBalance)) == 0

### CA8 : l'évolution suit En banque (2900) ; son forecastBalance (départ complet + toute la fenêtre = 1050 + 860 = 1910) ne change pas
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{accA.id}}/reporting/evolution
Authorization: Bearer {{alice.access_token}}

?? status == 200
?? js response.parsedBody[0].realBankBalance == 290000
?? js response.parsedBody[0].forecastBalance == 191000

### CA8 : la simulation avec les budgets enregistrés donne le même prévu et aucun effet
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{accA.id}}/periods/{{perA.id}}/reporting/forecast-simulation
Authorization: Bearer {{alice.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "budgets": [
  { "categoryId": "{{salaire.id}}", "amountAllocated": "200000" },
  { "categoryId": "{{courses.id}}", "amountAllocated": "40000" },
  { "categoryId": "{{resto.id}}", "amountAllocated": "10000" },
  { "categoryId": "{{loyer.id}}", "amountAllocated": "80000" } ] }

?? status == 200
?? js response.parsedBody.forecastBalance == 175000
?? js response.parsedBody.delta == 0
?? js response.parsedBody.incomeEffect == 0
?? js response.parsedBody.expensesEffect == 0

### CA5 (S1) : baisser le budget Courses (400 -> 200) alors que 300 sont dépensés : prévu +100 (le dépassement n'est plus masqué par Loyer ou Restaurant)
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{accA.id}}/periods/{{perA.id}}/reporting/forecast-simulation
Authorization: Bearer {{alice.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "budgets": [
  { "categoryId": "{{salaire.id}}", "amountAllocated": "200000" },
  { "categoryId": "{{courses.id}}", "amountAllocated": "20000" },
  { "categoryId": "{{resto.id}}", "amountAllocated": "10000" },
  { "categoryId": "{{loyer.id}}", "amountAllocated": "80000" } ] }

?? status == 200
?? js response.parsedBody.expensesEffect == 10000
?? js response.parsedBody.delta == 10000

