GET {{baseUrl}}/{{accA.id}}/periods/{{perA.id}}/reporting/stats

?? status == 401

### CA4 (exemple F) : prime +300 pointée datée après la fin (02/11)
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{accA.id}}/transactions
Authorization: Bearer {{alice.access_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "categoryId": "{{prime.id}}", "date": "2026-11-02", "description": "prime", "amount": "30000", "reconciled": true }

?? status == 201

### CA4 : En banque 3200, À venir 3100, prévu inchangé 1750, arrivé après la fin -300, composition = prévu
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{accA.id}}/periods/{{perA.id}}/reporting/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{alice.access_token}}

?? status == 200
?? js response.parsedBody.realBankBalance == 320000
?? js response.parsedBody.upcomingBalance == 310000
?? js response.parsedBody.forecastBalance == 175000
?? js response.parsedBody.arrivedAfterEnd == -30000
?? js Number(BigInt(response.parsedBody.realBankBalance) + BigInt(response.parsedBody.cardTotal) + BigInt(response.parsedBody.billsTotal) + BigInt(response.parsedBody.reportsTotal) + BigInt(response.parsedBody.arrivedAfterEnd) + BigInt(response.parsedBody.budgetRemaining) + BigInt(response.parsedBody.expectedIncome) - BigInt(response.parsedBody.forecastBalance)) == 0

### CA4 : l'évolution compte aussi la prime (3200) ; son forecastBalance ne la compte pas (1910)
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{accA.id}}/reporting/evolution
Authorization: Bearer {{alice.access_token}}

?? status == 200
?? js response.parsedBody[0].realBankBalance == 320000
?? js response.parsedBody[0].forecastBalance == 191000

